{'symbol': 'AWK', 'date': '2022-01-19 10:00:00', 'title': "AMERICAN WATER NAMED ONE OF THE TOP TEN WORLD'S MOST SUSTAINABLE CORPORATIONS", 'text': "CAMDEN, N.J.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--AMERICAN WATER (NYSE: AWK), THE LARGEST PUBLICLY-TRADED U.S. WATER AND WASTEWATER UTILITY COMPANY, ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS BEEN NAMED ON CORPORATE KNIGHTS' 18TH ANNUAL GLOBAL 100 LIST OF THE WORLD'S MOST SUSTAINABLE CORPORATIONS FOR THE THIRD YEAR IN A ROW. AMERICAN WATER IS THE TOP-RANKED WATER UTILITY COMPANY ON THE LIST AND IS RANKED SIXTH ON THE OVER-ALL LIST. “AT AMERICAN WATER, WE SUPPORT AND EMBRACE ENVIRONMENTAL, SOCIAL AND GOVERNANCE (ESG) GOALS BECAU"}